explosive (in phonetics). See TECH- NICAL TERMS,
===
**explosive** (in phonetics). See ^^TECHNICAL TERMS^^.
>>>

<<<
+ export, n. & v. See Noun & VERB ACCENT.
===
+ **export,** n. & v. See ^^NOUN & VERB ACCENT^^.
